WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,980
Peeping at me using the toilet in the dormitory

2
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:08,160
I just came back from the other side of the beach

3
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,440
There's not even a bird around

4
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,560
Yesterday you forced me to go into the sea to catch fish and I didn’t agree.

5
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,600
I changed to this way of playing today.

6
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:19,410
It's enough that you peeked at me going to the toilet.

7
00:00:19,410 --> 00:00:21,210
We are on a desert island now, not in a hotel

8
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:22,970
A dozen women stay with one man

9
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:27,030
Who knows what will happen at night these days

10
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:28,590
Firewood Coconut Snacks Shed

11
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:29,590
Basically it’s all done in dormitories.

12
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:30,950
I didn't say force him to death either.

13
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:32,030
Stay away from us at night

14
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:33,830
Come back during the day to check and pick coconuts

15
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:36,110
Everyone is trying to survive. He is a grown man.

16
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:37,470
What's wrong with doing more physical work?

17
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:39,790
We already understand him enough

18
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:43,020
Guarding against me at night is like guarding against thieves

19
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,220
You still want me to come back during the day

20
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:46,300
I will act like a cow and a horse for you, you are a man

21
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:47,620
What's wrong with doing more physical work?

22
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:48,620
Nothing much

23
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:50,500
It's because you use me as a thief at night

24
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,180
During the day, you still want to treat me like cow shit

25
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,460
This understanding

26
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:57,200
You can keep it for yourselves. Don't be impulsive in the dormitory. We really want to separate.

27
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:59,680
It’s no joke on the island, no need to persuade

28
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:01,120
Since you think I'm dangerous

29
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:02,560
Then don’t feel sorry for yourself during the day

30
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:04,560
From now on, everyone lives their own lives

31
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:05,800
Just pretend you never knew me

32
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:09,820
He's really gone

33
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:11,540
Who will pick coconuts and move wood from now on?

34
00:01:11,540 --> 00:01:13,180
What are a dozen women worried about?

35
00:01:13,180 --> 00:01:14,540
Still can't live without a man

36
00:01:14,540 --> 00:01:15,660
From now on, whoever is looking for a job will pick the coconuts

37
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:17,500
Wouldn't it be enough if we all share a share, without him?

38
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:18,460
We still live

39
00:01:19,460 --> 00:01:21,180
Deep sea song system starts

40
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:23,580
Wangwu synthesis has been unlocked

41
00:01:23,580 --> 00:01:25,460
Shrunk branches can be synthesized

42
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:28,460
Palm leaf stone flakes

43
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:32,940
Can be synthesized into Palm Lu Cottage

44
00:01:35,930 --> 00:01:36,930
Increase physical strength

45
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,130
All take 150 meters

46
00:01:38,130 --> 00:01:39,530
Two giant coconut machines

47
00:01:41,780 --> 00:01:43,620
The days when I left you and me

48
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:45,540
Instead, it started to get better.

49
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:46,860
No problem chasing me now

50
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:48,700
Never come to beg me again
